4. Recommend the top 3 for {{HORIZONTE_CICLO}} in {{SEGMENTO_OBJETIVO}} with a quantified success criterion, guardrail metric, and estimated duration; indicate what goes to the backlog and what is discarded, with reasoning.
5. Assess portfolio risk: whether the top concentrates effort on a single funnel stage or lever, and whether it makes sense to balance risky bets against fast learnings.

Neutral English, professional tone, no embellishment. Every score and tiebreak must be defensible before the team. If evidence is weak across the entire backlog, say so instead of simulating precision.

