Mark all inferred data with [SUPUESTO]. Flag where the plan depends on the direct manager's style or the company's culture. Close with the three highest-leverage moves for the first fourteen days. Neutral, professional English, no emojis.

pr-liderazgo_coaching_autoconciencia_lid:
