Produce the policy in four phases:

1) Inventory and risk classification. From {{INVENTARIO_HERRAMIENTAS}}, list each tool or action and classify it as green (read-only, reversible, no external effects), amber (reversible write or mutation, bounded effects), or red (irreversible, financial, destructive, or exposing {{RECURSOS_SENSIBLES}}). Justify each level in one line and flag separately the green→red chains (green actions that combined produce a red effect).

